+	"in bpf_prog_%02x%02x%02x%02x%02x%02x%02x%02x_%s"
+#define KASAN_PATTERN_SLAB_OOB "BUG: KASAN: slab-out-of-bounds " \
+	"in bpf_prog_%02x%02x%02x%02x%02x%02x%02x%02x_%s"
